5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Let's find the werewolf quickly! I'm ready for a big adventure!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,Let us keep a cool head. Haste often leads to mistakes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,...Hello.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. Let's all try to get along and find the truth together.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help the village.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, you're so quiet! Are you hiding something? Hehe!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Now, Rin, don't be so aggressive. It's only the first day.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'm... not hiding anything. I'm just... not good at this.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, Rin dear. Daisuke is just a bit shy. Be gentle with him.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I understand how you feel, Daisuke-san. It's okay to take your time.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,I just want to make this exciting! Who do you think is the werewolf?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,It is too early to make accusations. We should observe each other first.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree... with George-san.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,I think George is right. Let's listen to one another with open hearts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree. Harmony is important, even when we are searching for a werewolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
