32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Wake up, everyone! Did the Seer find anything cool last night?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,Let us see if anyone has information to share.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,...I don't have any information.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Good morning. I'm afraid I have some very sad news to share with you all.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning. Is something wrong, Shizue-san?","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, what is it? Tell us, tell us!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,"Please, Shizue, take your time and speak clearly.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,...I'm scared.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I used my power to look into George-san's heart... and I found a werewolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Oh my... George-san, is that true?","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Wow! A werewolf right away! George, you're a monster!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,"I see. A bold claim, Shizue. But I assure you, I am a simple villager.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,...George-san... are you really...?,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I am so sorry, George-san. I truly wish I were mistaken.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Midori,,"This is so distressing. I want to believe everyone, but the Seer's word is vital.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,Let's just vote him out! Then we can have a party!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,It is a shame that you trust a single word over my character. I will accept your judgment.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,...I'll... I'll vote for George-san.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I feel very heavy-hearted, but for the village, we must act.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm sorry, George-san. I have to trust Shizue-san's divination.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
